    "body": "## Problem:\r\n\r\n:checkhealth did not find health modules available only through package.path.\r\n\r\n## Solution:\r\n\r\nSearch package.path for named health modules when runtimepath lookup finds none, and add a regression test.\r\n\r\nAI-assisted: yes\r\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-09T13:33:27Z",
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "What's the motivation for this?\r\n\r\nAlso this is a feature, not a fix, since `:checkhealth` is explicitly documented to only check under `$VIMRUNTIME`, `'runtimepath'`, and `'packpath'`.",
