            "body": "> support health checking explicitly named modules that lua can load but can't health check\r\n\r\nbut why should we support that if they aren't in 'runtimepath' ?\r\n\r\ngiven the security risk and unclear use-case this doesn't seem worth it\r\n\r\nthere is also a clear workaround already: add the modules to 'runtimepath'?",
